      "template": "<div lang=\"en\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/en/collection/state-bank-new-brunswick/1-dollar/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/en/collection/obsolete-united-states-banknotes/#state-bank-new-brunswick\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; Catalog</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">Obsolete Banknote &middot; New Jersey &middot; c. 1860</span>\n\n          <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,46px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">The State Bank at New Brunswick</h1>\n\n          <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">$1.00 &middot; New Brunswick, New Jersey</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:660px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 56px;\">\n          <button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"state-bank-new-brunswick\"\n            aria-label=\"Enlarge image of the banknote\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n          >\n            <div style=\"border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.15); padding:10px; background:#fff;\">\n              <picture>\n                <source srcset=\"/uploads/state-bank-new-brunswick-1-dollar.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                <img\n                  src=\"/uploads/state-bank-new-brunswick-1-dollar.jpg\"\n                  alt=\"Obsolete one-dollar banknote of The State Bank at New Brunswick, New Jersey, obverse and reverse, circa 1860\"\n                  width=\"564\"\n                  height=\"490\"\n                  loading=\"eager\"\n                  decoding=\"async\"\n                  style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n                />\n              </picture>\n            </div>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Enlarge</span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Obverse (top) and reverse (bottom) — Notofilia.com Collection</span>\n<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Country / State</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">United States/New Jersey</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Issuing Entity</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">The State Bank at New Brunswick (New Brunswick, NJ)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denomination</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">$1.00 (One Dollar)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Epoch / Type</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Obsolete Bill (historically known as<em>&ldquo;Broken Banknotes&rdquo;</em> o <em>&ldquo;Wildcat Notes&rdquo;</em>)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Estimated Date</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">c. 1860s (Civil War era)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Catalog Reference</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Haxby NJ-350-G14a</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Serial Number</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">9890 (Plate B)</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n          \n            <div\n              role=\"dialog\"\n              aria-modal=\"true\"\n              aria-label=\"Enlarged banknote\"\n              data-zoom-dialog=\"state-bank-new-brunswick\" hidden\n             \n             class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n              <button\n                data-zoom-close\n                aria-label=\"Close\"\n                style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&times;</button>\n\n              <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n                <button type=\"button\" data-zoom-out\n                  disabled=\"true\"\n                  aria-label=\"Zoom out\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&minus;</button>\n                <span data-zoom-percent style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n                <button\n                  disabled=\"false\"\n                  data-zoom-in aria-label=\"Zoom in\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&#43;</button>\n              </div>\n\n              <div\n                style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:calc(100vw - 16px); max-height:calc(100vh - 16px); touch-action:none;\"\n              >\n                <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"/uploads/state-bank-new-brunswick-1-dollar.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                  <img data-zoom-image\n                    src=\"/uploads/state-bank-new-brunswick-1-dollar.jpg\"\n                    alt=\"Obsolete banknote of un dólar de The State Bank at New Brunswick, enlarged view\"\n                    draggable=\"false\"\n                    style=\"display:block; max-width:calc(100vw - 16px); max-height:calc(100vh - 16px); width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n                  />\n                </picture>\n              </div>\n\n              <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:16px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic; pointer-events:none;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n            </div>\n          \n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          \n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Color Scheme</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Obverse:</strong>black ink on white paper, with a distinctive green background print (security ink) featuring a circular geometric pattern at center and green text elements.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverse:</strong>printed entirely in green ink, in the precursor style of the well-known<em>&ldquo;greenbacks&rdquo;</em>.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Vignettes and Images of the Obverse</h2>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Center:</strong>a young woman within a circular frame, holding what appears to be an agricultural or textile tool (possibly a spinning wheel or rake handle), symbolizing labor and domestic industry.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Left side:</strong>a multisection stone-arch bridge crossed by an early steam locomotive; below, a barge travels the waterway &mdash; celebrating New Jersey's industrial revolution and transportation infrastructure.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Right side:</strong>a detailed scene of agricultural abundance, with a vegetable harvest, cornstalks, and farming tools.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Upper corners:</strong>large intricate geometric rosettes with the number &ldquo;1&rdquo;.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Reverse Images</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">It features a large central patriotic shield with vertical stripes and a field of stars, flanked by olive branches. On either side are two large green rosettes of geometric filigree displaying a stylized number &ldquo;1&rdquo;.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Typography and Text</h2>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Main title:</strong>&ldquo;The State Bank of New Brunswick&rdquo;, in an ornate, bold, Victorian serif typeface.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Payment promise:</strong>&ldquo;Will pay ONE DOLLAR to bearer on demand&rdquo;.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Location:</strong>&ldquo;STATE OF NEW JERSEY&rdquo; and &ldquo;NEW BRUNSWICK&rdquo;.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Signatures and Security</h2>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Cashier:</strong>signed on the bottom left (seems to read<em>M. Coddington</em>or a similar historical official).</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">President:</strong>signature line at bottom right (blank, style<em>remainder</em>, or faded signature).</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Engraver / Printer:</strong>Designed with guilloche and high security engraving to prevent counterfeiting of currency issued by private banks before the national banking law.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n          <blockquote style=\"margin:48px 0 0; padding:28px 0 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.15);\">\n            <p style=\"font-size:20px; font-style:italic; line-height:1.7; color:#4a4331; margin:0 0 10px;\">Before the US federal government standardized paper money with National Bank Notes and Legal Tender Notes during the Civil War, private banks chartered by each state issued their own notes. The State Bank at New Brunswick was one of these institutions. This piece represents the pinnacle of the art of banknote engraving in the United States, highlighting the importance of commerce, agriculture, and technological progress of the time.</p>\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33;\">&mdash; Historical Context Note</span>\n          </blockquote>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:32px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); padding-top:24px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 12px; font-style:normal;\">Sources</h2>\n            <ul style=\"margin:0; padding:0 0 0 20px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; color:#5c4e33; font-style:italic;\">\n              <li>Haxby, James A.<em>Standard Catalog of United States Obsolete Bank Notes, 1782&ndash;1866.</em></li>\n              <li>Heritage Auctions —<a href=\"https://www.ha.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">ha.com<span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:400;\">(opens in a new tab)</span></a></li>\n              <li>Numista —<a href=\"https://en.numista.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">numista.com<span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:400;\">(opens in a new tab)</span></a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n\n</div>",
      "recordTitle": "The State Bank at New Brunswick",
      "eyebrow": "Banknote Obsoleto · New Jersey · c. 1860"
    }
